  "aboutParagraphs": [
    "Fountain Hills is one of the most scenic courses in Arizona — 20 holes around a man-made lake beneath the iconic 300-foot fountain, with lots of trees, well-manicured grass, and nine water hazards in play. It's been a Phoenix-area classic since 1981.",
    "Free to play with concrete tees and Mach X baskets, it's very cart friendly with restrooms and camping nearby. Multiple pin placements on many holes keep the round fresh, and the fountain's hourly show is a perfect mid-round break.",
    "The water is the whole game — the lakes come into play on several holes, and the scenery makes even the bad shots worth it."
  ],
