  "signatureHoleDescription": "Hole 5 is the longest at Fountain Hills at 457 feet — a par 3 that plays along the lake with the iconic fountain rising behind the basket. It's the most photographed hole in Arizona disc golf, and the water makes it far more nerve-wracking than the scenery suggests.",
  "localTips": "The fountain goes up on the hour — time your visit. The lakes are in play on several holes, so bring your most reliable discs. Free to play, very cart friendly, restrooms and camping nearby.",
